. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D. found stellar results:\\n\\n✓ Waist circumference decreased by 4.48 cm\\n✓ 59% increase in abdominal strength\\n✓ 42% increase on max duration when holding a plank position\\n✓ 121% increase in abdominal endurance\\n✓ 74% felt that their posture had improved\\n✓ 100% of the NMES group felt that their midsections were more toned and firmed\\n\\n“The NMES offers a promising alternative to traditional strength training for enhancing the strength parameters and motor abilities described above. Because of the clear-cut advantages in time management, we can expect this method to see the increasing use in high-performance sports.” -Dr. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D.\\n\\nShop Now to Get Yours While It's Still 49% OFF + FREE Worldwide Shipping!\",\n          \"title\": \"SALE ENDS TODAY!\",\n          \"caption\": \"abstimulator.news\",\n          \"linkUrl\": \"https://abstimulator.news/pages/t5-abs-stimulator\",\n          \"linkDescription\": \"Do Ab Stimulators Actually Work? We Tested 14 to Find Out. We expected to debunk the whole category. The technology turned out to be real. Most of the products aren't.\",\n          \"callToAction\": \"Shop now\",\n          \"callToActionType\": \"SHOP_NOW\",\n          \"displayFormat\": \"IMAGE\",\n          \"images\": [\n            {\n              \"url\": \"https://scontent-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/791227723_1082641324295257_4249794444817469427_n.jpg?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=Fa2PdlpTQvkQ7kNvwFXvQcl&_nc_oc=AdrEALLEI25Q7AqcGbCgh0AEPF6snGaNkcoFKjNYFQIbiFTGAGH624HjYe0JxXGF0Nk&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.xx&_nc_gid=KAtc36otxCMlEdXH4WFHJA&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQReJxmtve3diyq0_fooIaPI-xsI-naRBoRjBPiZk3APOg&oe=6AF3BD68\",\n              \"resizedUrl\": \"https://scontent-lga3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/788550125_2217683138792295_8323150730045197336_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=90Zf1KmQ6zUQ7kNvwFRFr01&_nc_oc=AdpagFxK3xqtxmtP1-O0KmYj0T3rQ5M