s in time management, we can expect this method to see the increasing use in high-performance sports.” -Dr. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D.\\n\\nShop Now to Get Yours While It's Still 49% OFF + FREE Worldwide Shipping!\",\n          \"title\": \"53% OFF + FREE Shipping Today!\",\n          \"caption\": \"apebornfitness.com\",\n          \"linkUrl\": \"https://apebornfitness.com/products/nextgen-ultra-full-body-stimulator-kit\",\n          \"linkDescription\": null,\n          \"callToAction\": \"Shop now\",\n          \"callToActionType\": \"SHOP_NOW\",\n          \"displayFormat\": \"VIDEO\",\n          \"images\": [],\n          \"videos\": [\n            {\n              \"hdUrl\": \"https://video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQPOf6MfurtqkJu1ioPOOwehEoFFPvBA3o2A0Eb0c82wC-jmo-wJd84m8AjwmmYMyjmn-OkqtZexmMiAYXBh57Sv9lBkYcDpMEHbEAWGiVUyYQ.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=cWx14cNzKuUQ7kNvwHsj_04&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjIwMzc3MTY3MDY5MTM4NTUsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo4LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDEzOSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTU2LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=c624f4099e361fe4&_nc_vs=HBksFQIYRWZiX2VwaGVtZXJhbC84RDI0OTQwQkFEOTQ0Qjk4QURBOEFFQzlFQzY2QjQ1Rl9tdF8xX3ZpZGVvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUAAsgBEgAVAhhAZmJfcGVybWFuZW50Lzg0Q0NEQjg4RjNDMDQxNkJBNzdCNjQwN0YxNjBFMTZDX2F1ZGlvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUCAsgBEgAoABgAGwKIB3VzZV9vaWwBMRJwcm9ncmVzc2l2ZV9yZWNpcGUBMRUAACb-uL_H3NKeBxUCKAJDMywXQGOGTdLxqfwYGWRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHARAHUAZbaeAQA&_nc_gid=KAtc36otxCMlEdXH4WFHJA&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQXOzN0b8gnY5Q-9FYxbeb1zAfkDWJLR6dTe3OnOIiPhQ&oe=6AF3DD5B\",\n              \"sdUrl\": \"https://video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQN8t_zj8vhjaor3BHJ8R0zOPzY5tPfoXln2gq7rj42zYhwdxIhDrifBVtdv6Kdu6cO8_TH1lYvIoKm3D2RswMn6DskrPhdmIO-HTYqA2g.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_sid=ef5aa3&_nc_ht=video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=XE8rx70jBR4Q7k