 much the nerve is firing changes what muscle fibers are recruited.\n\nThis is in no way a shortcut to getting stronger, faster, and more toned. But having the ability to contract muscles at the optimal intensity of your choosing is a great advantage to have.\n\nThe results? An 8-week study on Muscle Stimulators led by industry-leading NMES scientist Dr. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D. found stellar results:\n\n✓ Waist circumference decreased by 4.48 cm\n✓ 59% increase in abdominal strength\n✓ 42% increase on max duration when holding a plank position\n✓ 121% increase in abdominal endurance\n✓ 74% felt that their posture had improved\n✓ 100% of the NMES group felt that their midsections were more toned and firmed\n\n“The NMES offers a promising alternative to traditional strength training for enhancing the strength parameters and motor abilities described above. Because of the clear-cut advantages in time management, we can expect this method to see the increasing use in high-performance sports.” -Dr. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D.\n\nShop Now to Get Yours While It's Still 49% OFF + FREE Worldwide Shipping!","title":"SALE ENDS TODAY!","caption":"apebornfitness.com","linkUrl":"https://apebornfitness.com/pages/advertorial-hip-kit","linkDescription":"A physical therapist explains how EMS muscle stimulation supports abdominal training and why 20-minute sessions can complement traditional core exercises.","callToAction":"Shop now","callToActionType":"SHOP_NOW","displayFormat":"IMAGE","images":[{"url":"https://scontent-lga3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/823221812_2292960344789490_8697741615394570352_n.jpg?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=W2DTksD6dsEQ7kNvwFcwqq4&_nc_oc=AdrCpChqmj74mstogFD3V4FSsMGbgOfvjjcZgN_svxwQw48wDbH9DpY4h6EAUhIAoo4&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.xx&_nc_gid=KAtc36otxCMlEdXH4WFHJA&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQS5ia6aAesNXg93-MRLTUIVF6No2XlLTiQEJra4D7CL1g&oe=6AF3E721","resizedUrl":"https://scontent-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/822297976_1111511408522669_54586556304