hen holding a plank position\n✓ 121% increase in abdominal endurance\n✓ 74% felt that their posture had improved\n✓ 100% of the NMES group felt that their midsections were more toned and firmed\n\n“The NMES offers a promising alternative to traditional strength training for enhancing the strength parameters and motor abilities described above. Because of the clear-cut advantages in time management, we can expect this method to see the increasing use in high-performance sports.” -Dr. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D.\n\nShop Now to Get Yours While It's Still 49% OFF + FREE Worldwide Shipping!","title":"53% OFF + FREE Shipping Today!","caption":"apebornfitness.com","linkUrl":"https://apebornfitness.com/products/nextgen-ultra-full-body-stimulator-kit","linkDescription":null,"callToAction":"Shop now","callToActionType":"SHOP_NOW","displayFormat":"VIDEO","images":[],"videos":[{"hdUrl":"https://video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m366/AQPOf6MfurtqkJu1ioPOOwehEoFFPvBA3o2A0Eb0c82wC-jmo-wJd84m8AjwmmYMyjmn-OkqtZexmMiAYXBh57Sv9lBkYcDpMEHbEAWGiVUyYQ.mp4?_nc_cat=101&_nc_sid=b66105&_nc_ht=video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=cWx14cNzKuUQ7kNvwHsj_04&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6Inhwdl9wcm9ncmVzc2l2ZS5WSV9VU0VDQVNFX1BST0RVQ1RfVFlQRS4uQzMuNzIwLmRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHAiLCJ4cHZfYXNzZXRfaWQiOjIwMzc3MTY3MDY5MTM4NTUsImFzc2V0X2FnZV9kYXlzIjo4LCJ2aV91c2VjYXNlX2lkIjoxMDEzOSwiZHVyYXRpb25fcyI6MTU2LCJ1cmxnZW5fc291cmNlIjoid3d3In0%3D&ccb=17-1&vs=c624f4099e361fe4&_nc_vs=HBksFQIYRWZiX2VwaGVtZXJhbC84RDI0OTQwQkFEOTQ0Qjk4QURBOEFFQzlFQzY2QjQ1Rl9tdF8xX3ZpZGVvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUAAsgBEgAVAhhAZmJfcGVybWFuZW50Lzg0Q0NEQjg4RjNDMDQxNkJBNzdCNjQwN0YxNjBFMTZDX2F1ZGlvX2Rhc2hpbml0Lm1wNBUCAsgBEgAoABgAGwKIB3VzZV9vaWwBMRJwcm9ncmVzc2l2ZV9yZWNpcGUBMRUAACb-uL_H3NKeBxUCKAJDMywXQGOGTdLxqfwYGWRhc2hfaDI2NC1iYXNpYy1nZW4yXzcyMHARAHUAZbaeAQA&_nc_gid=KAtc36otxCMlEdXH4WFHJA&_nc_ss=78180&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQQXOzN0b8gnY5Q-9FYxbeb1zAfkDWJLR6dTe3OnOIiPhQ&oe=6AF3DD5B","sdUrl":"https://video-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m412/AQN8t_zj8vhjaor3BH