ding NMES scientist Dr. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D. found stellar results:\n\n✓ Waist circumference decreased by 4.48 cm\n✓ 59% increase in abdominal strength\n✓ 42% increase on max duration when holding a plank position\n✓ 121% increase in abdominal endurance\n✓ 74% felt that their posture had improved\n✓ 100% of the NMES group felt that their midsections were more toned and firmed\n\n“The NMES offers a promising alternative to traditional strength training for enhancing the strength parameters and motor abilities described above. Because of the clear-cut advantages in time management, we can expect this method to see the increasing use in high-performance sports.” -Dr. Toshio Moritani, Ph.D.\n\nShop Now to Get Yours While It's Still 49% OFF + FREE Worldwide Shipping!","title":"SALE ENDS TODAY!","caption":"apebornfitness.com","linkUrl":"https://apebornfitness.com/products/nextgen-ultra-full-body-stimulator-kit","linkDescription":"Strengthen and tone your body with the Full Body EMS Muscle Stimulator Kit. This abs stimulator and ab toning belt targets multiple muscle groups for deeper activation.","callToAction":"Shop now","callToActionType":"SHOP_NOW","displayFormat":"IMAGE","images":[{"url":"https://scontent-lga3-2.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/825266353_1403064708202880_7820288600934589758_n.jpg?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=mmvYl4oF2V8Q7kNvwF3vwW5&_nc_oc=Adp2dQZndyW_t0cA2fzEvRVCJma_3idkVfGwaIiA5GDttYPKTONyQSUOcU7On0rl9iY&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.xx&_nc_gid=KAtc36otxCMlEdXH4WFHJA&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQQEySR9ilI8ajJuoDR9SAG1pbW4HO3NYnL4LFtdtMgtsw&oe=6AF3CE0C","resizedUrl":"https://scontent-lga3-3.xx.fbcdn.net/v/t39.35426-6/825266274_1444377685417979_7640449625786128902_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_s600x600_tt6&_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=c53f8f&_nc_ohc=RvKpCylpOI0Q7kNvwHCns_Q&_nc_oc=AdoWQD7JuHp_5WHRtvZo3-jqgznTJI0t3DfD_ll2_vuBn5tQkOGMgvSp856mHBOCWAo&_nc_zt=14&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.xx&_nc_gid=KAtc36otxCMlEdXH4WFHJA&_nc_ss=78180&oh=00_AQTFjoTUHHrLENAowjtKVrZ2XWnz_